{"id":"wb-7-706","name":"万松老人塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"万松老人塔","text":"万松老人塔，位于北京市西城区金融街街道西四南大街43号，砖塔胡同东口，为八角九层密檐式砖塔，是北京内城仅存的砖塔。该塔为万松行秀的墓塔，原为7层塔，始建于元代，该塔所在胡同也因其而得名为砖塔胡同。明清两代曾多次重修，其中清朝年间该塔被加盖至9层。中华民国大陆时期，叶恭绰等人曾专门成立万松老人塔的维护机构并对其加以修缮。中华人民共和国成立后，万松老人塔先后于1995年和2013年被列为北京市文物保护单位和全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%87%E6%9D%BE%E8%80%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%A1%94","revisionId":86295768,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86295768","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/6057b4ba1dc005935e4725ef.jpg","title":"万松老人塔西_20240115.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%B8%87%E6%9D%BE%E8%80%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%A1%94%E8%A5%BF_20240115.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/90/%E4%B8%87%E6%9D%BE%E8%80%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%A1%94%E8%A5%BF_20240115.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Uuongkinghe","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​万松老人塔西面","width":320,"height":480}}